    "bodyHtml": "<p data-seg=\"0\" class=\"seg-marker\">Dilian ///////</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/album=3309943983/size=large/bgcol=ffffff/linkcol=0687f5/tracklist=false/artwork=small/track=3992736859/transparent=true/\"><a href=\"https://clam-pressure.bandcamp.com/track/juicy-macro\">Juicy Macro by Dilian</a></iframe></p>\n<p data-seg=\"1\" class=\"seg-marker\">Computer man ///////</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/album=3651519720/size=large/bgcol=ffffff/linkcol=0687f5/tracklist=false/artwork=small/track=1320293791/transparent=true/\"><a href=\"https://c0mput3rm4n.bandcamp.com/track/i-am-evan-of-the-panax-flower-feat-ant-adventure-2\">I am Evan of the Panax Flower feat. ant. adventure.ᐟ by Computer man &amp; ant. adventure.ᐟ</a></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F2421169926&show_artwork=true\"></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F2209742735&show_artwork=true\"></iframe></p>\n<p data-seg=\"2\" class=\"seg-marker\">ant. adventure.ᐟ ///////</p>\n<p><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F2423647209&show_artwork=true\"></iframe></p>\n<p data-seg=\"3\" class=\"seg-marker\">ToySoldier ///////</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/album=3148654056/size=large/bgcol=ffffff/linkcol=0687f5/tracklist=false/artwork=small/track=635235998/transparent=true/\"><a href=\"https://muzik-label.bandcamp.com/track/take-me-home\">Take Me Home by ToySoldier</a></iframe></p>\n